Here is the root cause:
The bug was introduced due to improper handling of packet processing when there were no destinations and the input was holding. The logic did not account for the state of the connection correctly, leading to potential packet loss or incorrect session management. The modifications ensure that packets are only dropped when it is appropriate to do so, thus preventing unintended behavior in the HTTP output handling.

